   4i. THE BRK_VIN RANGE AND THE ON-TIME BOUND (round 12, the check's F2)
     the event can happen from BRK_VIN 7.6 V (C-PROT rev 1: the -1 runs from its power-on threshold, record l8p 12d; PORIT 7.6 V is
       a TYPICAL with an 8 V maximum and no minimum printed) to the pack's 16.8 V, the clamp's 29.2 V in a surge
