       latches whatever the load (no source). UNDER IT the latch rests on the faulted load persisting as PACK_P falls; if the load
       drops out (a constant-power load under its own UVLO, another protection acting) a unit whose limit is over the crowbar's own
       current leaves its limit, and the crowbar's own current through R10, over the window's least, HOLDS THE TRIP: the band
       7.71 to 9.43 V (the window's least through R140 at -1 %, the most limit through it at +1 %), 226 W in R140 held in round 11's
       drawing: a DEMONSTRATED DEFECT of the draft (no source); with a source's settled share on the record's B-R2 basis the -1 can
